<article class="env-lemma" id="00DO">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/00DO">Lemma <span data-tag="00DO">10.13.2</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a ring. Let $M_2 \to M_1 \to M \to 0$ be an exact sequence of $R$-modules. There are exact sequences </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  M_2 \otimes _ R \text{Sym}^{n - 1}(M_1) \to \text{Sym}^ n(M_1) \to \text{Sym}^ n(M) \to 0  \]
</div>
  <p> and similarly </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  M_2 \otimes _ R \wedge ^{n - 1}(M_1) \to \wedge ^ n(M_1) \to \wedge ^ n(M) \to 0  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Omitted. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>